{"detail":"ElevenLabs did not return audio. Content-Type=text/html; charset=utf-8. Body=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en-US\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <!-- v27467 -->\n\n\n  <title>Do you restrict access to the service and platform for any specific countries? &ndash; ElevenLabs</title>\n\n  \n\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"We are required to restrict access from the following countries:  Belarus Cuba Iran North Korea Russia Syria Crimea, and the Donetsk and...\" /><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://help.elevenlabs.io/hc/theming_assets/01HZQ08B6SDY5X53YN9AB"}